    <item>
      <title>Living in Deale, Maryland: Your Guide to Small-Town Chesapeake Bay Life</title>
      <link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/deale-maryland-guide/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/deale-maryland-guide/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Welcome to Deale, Maryland&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;welcome-to-deale-maryland&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#welcome-to-deale-maryland&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 5 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Your First Look at Deale&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;your-first-look-at-deale&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#your-first-look-at-deale&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Deale is where the Chesapeake Bay feels like your backyard. This small community on the southern end of Anne Arundel County&amp;rsquo;s Western Shore has a population around 5,000-5,500 people, which keeps it from ever feeling crowded. The name &amp;ldquo;Deale&amp;rdquo; comes from the early settlers who established the area in the 1700s, and walking through town you&amp;rsquo;ll still feel that small-town rhythm.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
